   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Future_420ba8.html\">ara::core::Future</a>&lt; <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ExtendedDataRecord_Namespace_ExtendedDataRecordElementInter_df5dc8.html\">&lt;ExtendedDataRecordElement&gt;ReadOutput</a> &gt; Read (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_MetaInfo_818707.html\">ara::diag::MetaInfo</a> &amp;metaInfo, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_diag_CancellationHandler_e2b2ab.html\">ara::diag::CancellationHandler</a> cancellationHandler) noexcept=0;</pre>",
